00:15:54,800 --> 00:15:56,260
I'm not giving you the key.

277
00:15:56,660 --> 00:15:56,940
What?

278
00:15:58,280 --> 00:15:58,800
Now.

279
00:15:59,620 --> 00:16:01,040
Tell me who you are.

280
00:16:02,240 --> 00:16:02,720
Maka.

281
00:16:03,260 --> 00:16:04,560
What are you talking about?

282
00:16:04,800 --> 00:16:05,440
You know me.

283
00:16:05,880 --> 00:16:06,800
You're not Sol.

284
00:16:07,520 --> 00:16:08,260
Shut up!

285
00:16:08,260 --> 00:16:09,280
Of course I am.

286
00:16:09,380 --> 00:16:10,180
Just look at me!

287
00:16:10,640 --> 00:16:11,080
Liar!

288
00:16:11,080 --> 00:16:13,820
Sol would never ask me for something like this.

289
00:16:14,340 --> 00:16:16,440
I'm asking because there's no other way.

290
00:16:16,700 --> 00:16:17,040
Okay.

291
00:16:17,540 --> 00:16:18,920
Tell me why you closed the door.

292
00:16:19,480 --> 00:16:21,660
The real Sol would never have closed it.

293
00:16:22,060 --> 00:16:23,360
Not if it would trap me, too.

294
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:25,720
He would have told me to turn back.

295
00:16:29,660 --> 00:16:31,040
I know my partner.

296
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:32,740
And you're not him.

297
00:16:33,880 --> 00:16:34,360
Yes.

298
00:16:34,600 --> 00:16:35,360
Nice one, Maka.

299
00:16:35,360 --> 00:16:36,700
You're not an idiot.

300
00:16:36,700 --> 00:16:42,940
Yeah, you're right.

301
00:16:43,660 --> 00:16:45,100
Well, half right, at least.

302
00:16:45,200 --> 00:16:46,420
I'm not the Sol you knew.

303
00:16:49,700 --> 00:16:50,440
It's you.

304
00:16:50,920 --> 00:16:51,360
Yes.

305
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:56,100
I may not look like your good friend, Sol, but I assure you I'm a genuine Sol eater.

306
00:16:56,460 --> 00:16:58,200
And I am a part of Sol as well.

307
00:16:58,620 --> 00:17:00,520
Just as he, too, is a part of me.

308
00:17:00,960 --> 00:17:03,500
Sol and I work together combined in a single body.

309
00:17:03,500 --> 00:17:08,120
We're partners, he and I, the kind that can't be separated no matter what.

310
00:17:08,840 --> 00:17:10,700
That's why I say you're only half right.

311
00:17:10,780 --> 00:17:12,940
I am Sol, but at the same time, I'm not.

312
00:17:13,120 --> 00:17:14,500
It's complicated, I know.

313
00:17:14,600 --> 00:17:16,340
