You are going to do what I say.

326
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:43,420
Do it!

327
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:46,060
Refusing to open the box won't help anything.

328
00:17:46,800 --> 00:17:50,520
If you don't unlock it, you'll have the pleasure of watching while Sol and I die.

329
00:17:50,940 --> 00:17:52,140
So you have two choices.

330
00:17:52,140 --> 00:17:55,560
Keep the box closed and kill me along with your dear friend.

331
00:17:56,080 --> 00:17:58,040
Or open it and meet a new Sol.

332
