334
00:18:04,500 --> 00:18:06,380
Sol is actually in here, though, right?

335
00:18:06,920 --> 00:18:08,400
He absolutely is.

336
00:18:08,740 --> 00:18:09,180
Right.

337
00:18:10,280 --> 00:18:11,380
